1
00:00:00,875 --> 00:00:03,135
I don't wanna cry on a big screen like that.

2
00:00:05,313 --> 00:00:07,043
(Leonard:)Okay.

3
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:10,610
(Leonard:)You know what?

4
00:00:10,885 --> 00:00:15,655
(Penny:)This might be the wine talking,
but I have an important question to ask you.

5
00:00:16,958 --> 00:00:17,978
(Leonard:)You do?

6
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:20,680
(Penny:)Leonard Hofstadter?

7
00:00:21,662 --> 00:00:23,462
(Leonard:)Yes?

8
00:00:25,266 --> 00:00:27,666
(Penny:)Will you be my Valentine?

9
00:00:29,804 --> 00:00:31,294
(Leonard:)Sorry, maybe next year.

10
00:00:34,208 --> 00:00:37,298
I'm just kidding! Romance ninja!
Let's have sex! Wah!

11
00:00:42,216 --> 00:00:43,776
(Nerdy guy:)Thank you, guys, for doing this.

12
00:00:43,985 --> 00:00:45,505
(Raj:)We're glad you could make it.

13
00:00:45,787 --> 00:00:50,817
(Nerdy guy:)Usually, I spend Valentine's Day sad
and alone. This year, I'm just sad.

14
00:00:53,227 --> 00:00:55,927
(Raj:)What is it about this holiday
that makes people so unhappy?

15
00:00:56,164 --> 00:00:59,564
(Stuart:)I know. I hate myself most of the time,
but tonight's the night I know...

